@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title D 数据层：六部门任务
left to right direction
entity "任务\ntasks" as tasks {
  * id : text <<PK>>
  * number : text
  * title : text
  * creator_id : text <<FK>>
  * department_id : text <<FK>>
  layout_type : text
  deadline : timestamp with time zone
  * notes : text
  * open_registration : boolean
  * urgent : boolean
  * created_at : timestamp with time zone
  * kind : text
  linked_task_id : text <<FK>>
  * config_version : integer <<FK>>
  reminder_hours : numeric(8,2)
  * report_note : text
}
entity "部门任务扩展\njobs" as jobs {
  * task_id : text <<PK FK>>
  * review_mode : boolean
  rule_id : integer <<FK>>
  complexity : text
  source_department : text <<FK>>
  teacher_id : text <<FK>>
  * urgent_reason : text
}
entity "预约资料\nbookings" as bookings {
  * task_id : text <<PK FK>>
  * location : text
  * contact : text
}
entity "稿件站点行\narticle_lines" as article_lines {
  * task_id : text <<PK FK>>
  * position : integer <<PK>>
  * title : text
  * site : text
  * original : boolean
  author_id : text <<FK>>
}
entity "人工登记\nwork_entries" as work_entries {
  * task_id : text <<PK FK>>
  * person_id : text <<FK>>
  * week : integer
  rule_id : integer <<FK>>
}
entity "部门\ndepartments" as departments {
  * id : text <<PK>>
  * name : text
}
article_lines --> tasks : (task_id)
bookings --> tasks : (task_id)
jobs --> departments : (source_department)
jobs --> tasks : (task_id)
tasks --> departments : (department_id)
tasks --> tasks : (linked_task_id)
work_entries --> tasks : (task_id)
legend bottom
箭头为外键依赖（指向被引用表），不是流程。
* 非空；PK主键；FK外键。完整唯一与检查约束见数据字典。
跨分区外键未全部显示，完整外键表列出所有79项。
endlegend

@enduml
